<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-15T17:53:41.069Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:53:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Yemeni government forces have withdrawn from positions around Dhubab Airport and the Bab al-Mandeb strait, allowing Houthi fighters to take control of the strategic waterway. Houthi forces have also intercepted Saudi-led coalition missile and drone attacks and killed a senior Yemeni military commander in clashes in Al-Jawf. Japan's ONE shipping group has transited the Red Sea choke point for the first time in three years, indicating limited commercial movement despite the fighting. A Houthi missile strike killed five people at a checkpoint near Aden. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/2e7028ba-987c-4874-9426-fe38a8753c67?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQQXMtd2xXRUhEMlFidC1EMEdNdlJUV0R4TmVtU0E4V1l5Vm9KeDBPdE5XZWkzM2FLcVpOMzA3LU83b1RfSzlxYlZIWDJWand2bGxZUzRkOGh3akJpVFZwaEp5YXVCZW53ZlJqQmlZUFlTR2lIRFlRbWVHM0NsVnkxeGdCTXMyTF9fdnZuOWpPSWZ3UG16VGtNa2Q3WU56UVJvU2RyNzhOeDZVeW1NT3ZQQVVIdUNISUNMUkdOaFRYMkduRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/15/world/middleeast/saudi-houthis-yemen-red-sea.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQVW9oR0pfVGQ2U3NYTWdTRktiZ1Z4TUFnb0UyUHJ0MTJ0ejVtQU12anZRTDg1ZmQ1cGlaS3VaUWYtM3MzdlBEcVRnVVZ1T2RONmtzMVg2SFRHeWRGQXVHb01WR1NCd1pwNXo3R0c3dWRwTHlaSXFYWlctYjhSWlVWb3BXSGNqdEdlMERpYVNQaEVfRUpmRFhWSURlcVFhNmNMekNlMy1XbDNEZVphNDJEQlA4T0pkYmFQZjlHdlBFaEtfYnpBRTE3X0E1elZXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNMnpuczY2ekhLTUFHSjNFclVfa09zQ0ZVUVJZV2RSY0xPZXZ2dlhIZUJtZ2Js